  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">5th International Conference on Integrated Natural Resources and Environment Management (INREM) 2025 - University of the Philippines Los Banos</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UPLB-Interdisciplinary Studies Center for Integrated Natural Resources and Environment Management (UPLB-INREM) will be conducting its 5th International Conference with the theme &#x201c;Innovating Through Integrated Natural Resources and Environment Management (INREM): Nature-Based Solutions for Sustainability and Resilience&#x201d; on 18 to 20 November 2025 in Manila, Philippines.

This 3-day gathering of members of the NBS Support Network, policy-makers, stakeholders, students and professionals is also the launch of the Philippines&#x2019; first ever carbon-neutral international conference and a model for NbS initiative for advancing ecosystem-based resilience and sustainable development.

The conference is expected to raise awareness, engagement and appreciation on current initiatives on NBS through INREM; generate ideas that will form the basis of future INREM-based research and activities; and, establish or strengthen contacts and foster cooperation among INREM practitioners and researchers.</narrative>
  </description>
